SUMMARY:2026-27 District PAC Meeting
DESCRIPTION:All meetings happen at 5:30 – 7:30 pm at various locations:\n\n\nSept. 21 at Fulton ES\nNov. 16 at McCaskey East Cafeteria\nJan. 25\, 2027  at Wharton ES\nMar. 15 at Lincoln MS\nMay 17 – TBD\n\n*Locations and dates subject to change \n\nIf you have any questions\, please contact Serena Gergenti\, Manager of Community & Family Engagement at serenagergenti@sdlancaster.org.
