SUMMARY:SDoL students saving nature youth panel: Wednesday\, November 18\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:  \nYoung people have a voice in the future of our environment. Come hear what they have to say at the Saving Nature Youth Panel on Wednesday\, Nov. 18\, from 5:30 to 7:30 p.m. at 520 North St. in Lancaster. \nModerated by Lydia Martin\, the evening will feature a conversation with youth panelists\, a chance to ask questions\, and food and fun. Join us to listen\, learn and support young people as they share their perspectives on saving nature. \nSign up here 
URL:https://sdlancaster.org/event/sdol-students-saving-nature-youth-panel-wednesday-november-18-2026/
LOCATION:The Mix\, 520 North Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602
CATEGORIES:All Events
END:VEVENT
